Cinema 4D (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" aria-current=\"page\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"publish-from-ifc-or-usd\">Publish from IFC or USD<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#publish-from-ifc-or-usd\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p>Upload the building model or the USD scene you already have and get a\nshare link where every object can be clicked for its properties and every\nstorey switched off. Nothing to convert on your side.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-to-upload\">What to upload<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-to-upload\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>You have</th><th>Upload</th><th>What comes out</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A BIM model from Revit, ArchiCAD, Tekla, Allplan, BricsCAD, Bonsai/BlenderBIM…</td><td>the <code>.ifc</code> file (IFC2x3 or IFC4)</td><td>one object per product with its <strong>GlobalId, IFC type, name, storey and property sets</strong> (Pset_*, quantities, type psets)</td></tr><tr><td>A USD scene from Omniverse, Houdini, Maya, Blender, Reality Composer</td><td>one self-contained <code>.usdz</code> (recommended), or a single <code>.usd</code> / <code>.usda</code> / <code>.usdc</code></td><td>one object per Mesh prim with its <strong>prim path and name</strong>, grouped by the Xform below the root; MaterialX (OpenPBR / standard_surface) or <code>UsdPreviewSurface</code> materials and the textures inside the file</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Both go through the same door as a GLB: the upload screen (drop the file),\n<code>POST /v1/ingest</code> (the bytes are recognised; <code>X-Verse-Kind: ifc</code> or <code>usd</code>\nis optional), or <code>@ctruhtech/verse-sdk</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"js\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-js\">const { job } = await verse.upload(file, { kind: &quot;ifc&quot;, name: &quot;tower-b&quot; });\nconst rec = await verse.waitForJob(job, { onStage: (s) =&gt; console.log(s) });\n// rec.url      → the share link\n// rec.propsUrl → the object index (per node: id, type, name, storey, props)\n// rec.convert  → { kind, schema, products, triangles, materials, storeys, seconds }</code></pre></div>\n<p>The build shows a <strong>converting</strong> stage with the product count, then the\nusual prepare → compile → sign → verify ladder. Limits are the ordinary\nones (512 MB one-shot, resumable above that); conversion has a 15-minute\nbudget.</p>\n<h2 id=\"in-the-link\">In the link<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#in-the-link\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><strong>Click an object</strong> — the marker names it and the <em>Objects</em> panel opens\non its type, storey, id and property sets.</li><li><strong>Objects panel</strong> (the stacked-layers button in the header): a tree by\nstorey, then by type, then product. Tick a storey or a type off to hide\nit — hidden objects are dropped before the renderer&#39;s visibility test,\nso a hidden floor costs nothing. <em>Isolate</em> keeps only the selected\nobject; <em>Show all</em> restores. Search by name, GlobalId, type or storey.</li><li><strong>Deep link</strong> — <em>Copy link</em> in the panel, or add <code>?select=&lt;GlobalId&gt;</code>\n(USD: the prim path) to the share URL; the link opens on that object and\norbits onto it.</li><li>Works in both tiers (WebGPU and WebGL2), in the playground and in embeds.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"embedding\">Embedding<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#embedding\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"html\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy-2\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-html\">&lt;div id=&quot;model&quot; style=&quot;height: 480px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;script src=&quot;https://HOST/embed.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\n&lt;script&gt;\n  const v = Verse.embed(document.getElementById(&quot;model&quot;), { vpk: &quot;ingest/tower-b-1a2b3c4d5e6f.vpk&quot; });\n  v.on(&quot;objects&quot;, ({ count, storeys, types }) =&gt; console.log(count, storeys, types));\n  v.on(&quot;select&quot;, ({ object }) =&gt; showPanel(object));          // click → the object&#39;s record\n  const index = await v.getProperties();                        // the whole index\n  const wall = await v.getProperties(&quot;2O2Fr$t4X7Zf8NOew3FLOH&quot;); // one object\n  v.setVisible(index.storeys.find((s) =&gt; s.name === &quot;Level 2&quot;).nodes, false);\n  v.isolate(index.types.IfcDoor);                               // only the doors\n  v.setVisible(&quot;all&quot;);\n  v.select(wall.id, { frame: true });\n&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre></div>\n<p>The props sidecar is also plain JSON: <code>GET /ingest/&lt;id&gt;.props.json</code>\n(private scenes: the owner&#39;s token or a share token, exactly like the\nscene). Its shape is documented in <a href=\"/docs/api#ifc-and-usd-2-7\" id=\"lnk-docs-api-md-ifc-and-usd\">docs/api.md → IFC and USD</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"getting-a-good-result\">Getting a good result<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#getting-a-good-result\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><strong>IFC</strong>: export with geometry (the &quot;Coordination View&quot; / &quot;Reference\nView&quot; MVDs are fine) and the property sets you want to see. Spaces,\nopenings, annotations and grids are left out on purpose. Products\nwithout a surface style take a palette by type (walls light, slabs grey,\ndoors wood, windows glass) so an unstyled model still reads as a\nbuilding; styled colours are kept. Large georeferenced models are moved\nto the origin.</li><li><strong>USD</strong>: pack a <code>.usdz</code> so the textures travel with the layer.\nReferences, payloads and sublayers that point at files <em>outside</em> the\nupload are not followed — flatten the stage first (<code>usdcat --flatten</code>,\nor export a USDZ). Mesh prims are read with their materials: a\n<strong>MaterialX</strong> network (<code>ND_open_pbr_surface_surfaceshader</code> from Blender\n4/5, Houdini, Omniverse; <code>ND_standard_surface_surfaceshader</code> from Maya /\nArnold) wins over the <code>UsdPreviewSurface</code> written beside it. Base colour,\nmetalness, roughness, normal and emission (with its strength) map to\nglTF PBR; coat, fuzz / sheen, transmission, specular weight / colour and\nIOR become the matching <code>KHR_materials_*</code> extensions, which render as\nlisted in <a href=\"/docs/guides/what-you-can-upload#what-is-rendered\" id=\"lnk-what-is-rendered\">what is rendered</a>\n(clearcoat, sheen, transmission and emission strength on both roads;\nspecular tint in Fidelity mode only — a streamed surface shows its base\nmaterial there). Separate metallic and roughness textures are packed into\none. A Z-up stage is stood upright and <code>metersPerUnit</code> applied (a\ncentimetre stage lands in metres). Not read: skinning, animation, point\ninstancers, subsurface, thin film. Files over 160 MB use the 64-bit\nconverter (the 436 MB Intel Sponza <code>.usda</code> converts in 7 s).</li><li>The viewer keeps one detail hierarchy <strong>per product</strong>, so a model with\ntens of thousands of tiny products streams more roots than a merged\nmesh would; group furniture or hardware at export time if the first\nview is slow to settle.</li><li>Need the lighting baked too? Both inputs end up as ordinary GLB scenes,\nso <a href=\"/docs/guides/bake-for-me\" id=\"lnk-bake-for-me\">Bake for me</a> applies when the file carries lights.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"when-it-does-not-work\">When it does not work<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#when-it-does-not-work\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Message</th><th>Why</th><th>What to do</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><em>This file isn&#39;t an IFC or USD we can read</em> (<code>bim_invalid</code>)</td><td>the bytes are not IFC/USD, the IFC has no products with geometry, or the USD has no Mesh prims</td><td>re-export with geometry; for USD flatten the stage</td></tr><tr><td><em>We couldn&#39;t convert this file</em> (<code>convert_failed</code>)</td><td>the converter crashed or ran past 15 minutes</td><td>try again; if it repeats, export GLB from your tool and send us the file details</td></tr><tr><td>objects without a storey</td><td>the IFC does not contain them through <code>IfcRelContainedInSpatialStructure</code> (or an aggregate of a contained element)</td><td>they are listed under <em>No storey</em> in the panel</td></tr></tbody></table></div></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#what-to-upload\" id=\"lnk-what-to-upload\">What to upload</a><a href=\"#in-the-link\" id=\"lnk-in-the-link\">In the link</a><a href=\"#embedding\" id=\"lnk-embedding\">Embedding</a><a href=\"#getting-a-good-result\" id=\"lnk-getting-a-good-result\">Getting a good result</a><a href=\"#when-it-does-not-work\" id=\"lnk-when-it-does-not-work\">When it does not work</a></aside></section>"}